All 4 counterexamples verified: in every case
    path(G) < (2 + u(G)) * dist_min(M(G^2)).

Note: the inequality is violated under BOTH natural readings of
dist_min(M(G^2)) -- distances measured in G^2 (columns RHS_G2) or
in G (columns RHS_G).  See README.md for the discussion of WOWII
definition 74 (u(G)) and of the distance ambiguity.
